comment.narrative:
-Support by technical backstopping firm;
-Installation of 22 data acquisition equipment;
-Installation of 200 Solar street lighting;
-Installation of 22 Solar hot water systems;
-Installation of 110 fence lighting systems;
-Supply and delivery of 20 biomass stoves and briquettes;
-Installation of 2 energy efficiency retrofit systems;
-Supply and delivery of 8 deployable solutions;
-Launching event for SE4S

- Support by technical backstopping firm: 1- support in drafting the ITB for the biomass boilers and identifying the possible raw material sources; 2- Review the ITB for the Biomass Expansion plant; 3- Review the design / ITB drafting for the retrofit technology; 4- Support in compiling the data collection / energy audit sheet for the PV / Wind technology; 5- Support in identifying potential sources for the Wind measurements for extrapolation;
- Installation of 22 data acquisition equipment: 3 weather stations installed and energy meters / earthing completed in 8 facilities - delivery of the remaining equipment to LAF. 2 workshops delivered at Ras Baalback on a)weather stations and b)energy metering for 15 participants in each;
- Installation of 200 Solar Street Lighting: 200 poles installed complete with lamps; batteries under procurement to rectify the damage following Aug 4 explosion. work expected to end in Q1 2021.
- Installation of 22 Solar hot water systems: 34 systems will be installed in 25 facilities, civil works completed for all systems and system installation expected to start Q4 2020;
- Installation of 110 fence lighting systems: 178 poles excavated. Electrical and civil works is ongoing;
- Supply and delivery of 20 biomass stoves and briquettes: 20 stoves installed with provision of 35tons of biomass briquettes. Shed installation is ongoing;
- Supply and installation of 10 biomass boilers with 200tons for biomass pellets: RFQ launched in Q4 of 2020;
- Installation of 2 energy efficient retrofit systems: RFQ expected to be launched in Q1 2021;
- Supply and delivery of 8 deployable solutions: shifted to year 3 (Q1 2021); grouped with the other two deployable solutions;
- Launching event for SE4S: postponed due to COVID-19 pandemic.ID-19 pandemic.
